    "title": "One Chaotic Hour at the Wedge From Tuesday, May 12th - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Haro ,\n7 hours ago Brad Jacobson spends a lot of time filming surf up and down the Southern California coastline. It’s a good place for a guy who likes to film surfing, because there are more than a few fantastic waves. There’s only one Wedge, though, and when it’s firing, Jacobson is there. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
